      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:28:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The Nasdaq 100 Index trimmed losses that had briefly tipped the gauge into bear-market territory and the S&amp;P erased most of an earlier large decline, with dip buyers emerging even as doubts remained about the outlook for artificial intelligence. The Russia/Ukraine War is testing NATO’s plan for military action. Plus, Trump is targeting China, EU with new tariffs citing overcapacity. All on the latest episode of “Bloomberg Businessweek Daily.” (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
